# How to setup

## Rosbag
Import the data bag from TU cloud to **~/CameraDrones/cdl_demo_catkin_ws_src**
 - 2019-11-18-19-37-10.bag: https://cloud.tugraz.at/index.php/s/WqiC7LQgDixP8kp

## Install octomap and point cloud tools
```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install ros-noetic-octomap-mapping ros-noetic-octomap-rviz-plugins ros-noetic-rgbd-launch ros-noetic-depth-image-proc libuvc-dev

rosdep update
cd ~/CameraDrones/cdl_demo_catkin_ws_src
rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y
```

If it doesn't work because the signing key (EXPKEYSIG) expired run:
```bash
curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.asc | sudo apt-key add -
sudo curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros/rosdistro/master/ros.key -o /usr/share/keyrings/ros-archive-keyring.gpg
```

# Assignment 1

